---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.jsx';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="VIRTUAL REALITY FAQ | Advanced Action Sports"
  description="Frequently asked questions about virtual reality at Advanced Action Sports in Massachusetts. Find answers about pricing, age requirements, glasses, and more."
  canonical="https://www.advancedactionsports.com/vr-faq"
  ogTitle="VIRTUAL REALITY FAQ | Advanced Action Sports"
  ogDescription="Frequently asked questions about virtual reality at Advanced Action Sports in Massachusetts."
>
<PageHero title="VIRTUAL REALITY FAQ" btnUrl="/virtual-reality/" btnText="Back to Virtual Reality" />

<section class="page-actions">
  <div class="container">
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-content faq-page">
  <div class="container">

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Will the VR make me dizzy?</h3>
      <p>Because of the high quality of our content and equipment, customers rarely experience motion sickness. We also start everyone with comfort settings enabled and can adjust on the fly.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Is there an age requirement?</h3>
      <p>We recommend that guests are at least 8 years old for VR experiences. Players under 13 must be accompanied by an adult. Some titles may have higher age recommendations.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>What if I wear glasses?</h3>
      <p>Our headsets fit most types of glasses. If your glasses do not fit, most customers can still see clearly due to how close the VR screens are to your eyes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How do you move in the games?</h3>
      <p>All of our VR experiences are free-roam, meaning you physically walk around in real life to move your avatar in the game. It is as real as it gets.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>How much does it cost?</h3>
      <p>VR Escape Rooms are $25 per player for a 50-minute experience. Short 10-minute experiences are available for $5 per person.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>If I have a Groupon, how do I book?</h3>
      <p>All you have to do is email or call, and we can help book you in.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Do we need a reservation?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Reservations or online bookings are required. Walk-ins are not guaranteed a time slot.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I bring in my own food?</h3>
      <p>Outside food and beverage, with the exception of water, is not permitted on site.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h3>Can I have alcohol onsite?</h3>
      <p>No. Alcohol, smokeless tobacco, and marijuana products are not permitted on site.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
